Package: survOmicsPkg
Title: Longitudinal Survival Analysis for Omics Biomarker Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lingdi", "Zhang", , "lingdihumboldt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a framework for survival analysis of longitudinal omics
  datasets. Supports baseline biomarker analyses, time-varying biomarker
  models, time-varying coefficient models, and baseline-versus-change
  decomposition using Cox proportional hazards models. Designed for
  high-throughput biomarker discovery in transcriptomic, proteomic,
  metabolomic, microbiome, and other longitudinal molecular studies.
URL: https://github.com/lingdi-zhang/survOmicsPkg
